            "text_gqDWgq": {
              "type": "text",
              "name": "t:names.text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Unlike engagement rings, wedding bands, class rings, and any other designs that have a particular meaning behind them, fashion rings don’t necessarily carry any symbolic significance. You wear these beautiful pieces simply to express your unique personal style and elevate your outfits.</p><p>From dainty stackable bands to lavish oversized diamond rings, fashion rings come in a wide range of designs to suit every taste and style. That’s what’s so great about them - you can always find the perfect fashion rings for you, no matter what you’re looking for!</p>",
