            "text_h4X7Nf": {
              "type": "text",
              "name": "t:names.text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>There really isn’t a right or wrong way to wear fashion rings. So, the way you choose to style your rings is completely up to you. However, a great tip is to always take into consideration the other accessories you’re wearing to create a cohesive look.</p><p>Don’t be afraid to wear more than one fashion ring at a time or to mix metals and styles. You can mix and match rings of different metal colors, pair minimalist designs with statement rings, or even stack several dainty rings on top of each other to give the illusion of being a single oversized ring - the sky’s the limit.</p><p>And, if you’re wondering whether you can wear fashion rings on your wedding finger, the truth is that it all boils down to personal preference. Some people choose not to do that for superstitious reasons, others don’t wear fashion rings on their ring finger because they don’t want people to think they’re engaged, and there are people who don’t mind any of that. There are no set rules, so just go with what’s best for you.</p>",
                "width": "100%",
                "max_width": "none",
