            "image": "shopify://shop_images/fashionRing-1.jpg",
            "image_position": "left",
            "title": "Gold fashion rings",
            "title_url": "shopify://collections/fashion-rings",
            "description": "<p>Whether you prefer yellow, white, or rose gold fashion rings, the truth is that gold rings are simply timeless. Not to mention, with three different gold shades to choose from, your design options are virtually endless. And, the best part is that you can mix and match rings of all three gold colors to create a fun and unique combo.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_QMDLcH": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/fashionRing-2.jpg",
            "image_position": "left",
            "title": "Diamond rings",
            "title_url": "shopify://collections/fashion-rings",
            "description": "<p>Don’t think for a second that diamond rings are exclusive to engagements. On the contrary, actually! After all, these stunning rings were worn as fashion accessories long before they became the iconic symbol of eternal love we associate with them today. From dainty stackable bands to oversized designs, diamond fashion rings are the perfect pieces to add some glitz and glam to any outfit and make quite the statement.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_QPiijw": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/fashionRing-3.jpg",
            "image_position": "left",
            "title": "Gemstone rings",
            "title_url": "shopify://collections/fashion-rings",
            "description": "<p>Sure, precious gemstones are incredibly elegant, but they’re much more than that. They’re a great way for you to add a pop of color and a touch of fun to any outfit, no matter the occasion. If you love to make a statement with eye-catching pieces, then bold cocktail rings are the perfect accessories for you. But, if you prefer daintier jewelry, opt for gemstone stackable bands to create minimalist-yet-colorful looks.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_Hdiicd": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/fashionRing-4.jpg",
            "image_position": "left",
            "title": "Stackable bands",
            "title_url": "shopify://collections/fashion-rings",
            "description": "<p>Speaking of stackable bands, these rings are the best accessories for you to express your personal style because you get to create unique ring combinations with them. Whether you prefer to stack them on top of each other or wear each ring on one finger, you get to use your creativity to mix and match stackable bands of different styles, widths, and metals to create something that’s entirely your own.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_yihAx4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/fashionRing-5.jpg",
            "image_position": "left",
            "title": "Cocktail rings",
            "title_url": "shopify://collections/fashion-rings",
            "description": "<p>Cocktail rings are must-have statement pieces as they take any outfit from plain to drop-dead gorgeous. Even though these bold statement rings were initially intended to be worn at night - while you’re having a cocktail at a party - more and more people have been incorporating these beautiful rings into their everyday style. So, if you feel like wearing them as everyday accessories, go for it. You won’t regret it!</p>",
